i.     Sunningdale SWMF E1 will be rescheduled from 2024 to 2027;

ii.    Stoney Creek SWMF 7.1 will be rescheduled from 2025 to 2027;

iii.   Stoney Creek SWMF 8 will be rescheduled from 2025 to 2028;

