v.    North Lambeth SWMF P2 South will be rescheduled from 2025 to 2026;

vi.   Pincombe Drain SWMF P3 West will be rescheduled from 2025 to 2026;

vii.  White Oaks SWMF 3 East will be rescheduled from 2025 to 2026;

